    "Name": "Ophanim C-OPM-O",
    "Details": "The Invictus is the primary configuration of the Ophanim, meant as the assault shock troopers of a Level II formation. Bringing four Heavy PPC, each with an attached capacitor, and two MRM-30 launchers to the battlefield. Relying on its raw attack power the configuration does mount less armor than expected of a Superheavy, but the strengthening traits of the Sanctus armor compensates to some degree. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Divine Fortress</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.29</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
